    "created_at": "2024-06-21T22:14:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-21T22:14:12Z",
    "body": "And just as some further context, TC39 is generally moving away from these implicit conversions; if we expect a number, newer APIs will *throw* rather silently convert when they get a NaN, or a string, or something else. Similarly for expecting an int and getting a non-int number, etc.\r\n\r\nDunno how much WebIDL desires to match this changeover, tho.",
